
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f1e3">
  <meta name="description" content="Create and customise your brand identity in KREOVANTA Brand Kit.">
  <title>Brand Kit | KREOVANTA</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
  <script src="app.js" defer></script>

  <style>
    .brand-page {
      width: min(1100px, 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 36px 20px 64px;
    }

    .brand-heading {
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .brand-heading h1 {
      font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4.2rem);
      line-height: 1;
      margin: 12px 0;
      color: var(--text, #12362b);
    }

    .brand-heading p {
      max-width: 650px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: var(--muted, #4f6258);
    }

    .brand-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .brand-panel {
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line, rgba(18,54,43,.16));
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: var(--card, #fffaf0);
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .brand-panel h2 {
      margin: 0 0 20px;
      font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: var(--text, #12362b);
    }

    .brand-field {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .brand-field label {
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: .92rem;
    }

    .brand-field input,
    .brand-field select {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 46px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line, rgba(18,54,43,.25));
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--bg, #f7f1e3);
      color: var(--text, #12362b);
      font: inherit;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    .brand-field input[type="color"] {
      padding: 5px;
      min-height: 50px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .brand-help {
      font-size: .83rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--muted, #4f6258);
    }

    .brand-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 22px;
    }

    .brand-save,
    .brand-reset {
      min-height: 46px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      font: inherit;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .brand-save {
      border: 1px solid #12362b;
      background: #12362b;
      color: #fffaf0;
    }

    .brand-reset {
      border: 1px solid var(--line, rgba(18,54,43,.25));
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text, #12362b);
    }

    .brand-status {
      min-height: 24px;
      margin-top: 16px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: var(--text, #12362b);
    }

    .brand-preview {
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line, rgba(18,54,43,.16));
      background: var(--preview-background, #f7f1e3);
      color: var(--preview-primary, #12362b);
      font-family: var(--preview-font, "Cormorant Garamond", serif);
    }

    .brand-preview-top {
      padding: 24px;
      background: var(--preview-primary, #12362b);
      color: #fffaf0;
    }

    .brand-preview-top small {
      letter-spacing: .14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
      font-size: .7rem;
    }

    .brand-preview-main {
      padding: 26px 22px;
    }

    .brand-preview-logo {
      display: block;
      width: auto;
      max-width: 100%;
      max-height: 72px;
      object-fit: contain;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .brand-preview-main h3 {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .brand-preview-main p {
      font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.7;
      font-size: .9rem;
      color: var(--preview-primary, #12362b);
    }

    .brand-preview-chip {
      display: inline-block;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 8px 13px;
      background: var(--preview-accent, #b48a2c);
      color: #fff;
      font-family: Inter, sans-serif;
      font-size: .8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .brand-swatches {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .brand-swatch {
      min-width: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--line, rgba(18,54,43,.16));
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--card, #fffaf0);
    }

    .brand-swatch-color {
      height: 48px;
    }

    .brand-swatch span {
      display: block;
      padding: 8px 5px;
      font: 11px Inter, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .brand-local-note {
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--bg2, #efe6d0);
      color: var(--text, #12362b);
      font-size: .86rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .brand-layout {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      }

      .brand-page {
        padding: 26px 14px 44px;
      }

      .brand-panel {
        padding: 18px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body data-page="brand-kit">
  <div data-kreovanta-nav></div>

  <main id="main-content" class="brand-page">
    <header class="brand-heading">
      <p class="brand-help">YOUR CREATIVE WORKSPACE / BRAND IDENTITY</p>
      <h1>Brand Kit</h1>
      <p>
        Give your creative work a recognisable identity. Choose your colours,
        typography and logo, then preview your brand before saving it.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="brand-layout">
      <section class="brand-panel" aria-labelledby="brand-settings-title">
        <h2 id="brand-settings-title">Your brand settings</h2>

        <form id="brand-kit-form">
          <div class="brand-field">
            <label for="brandName">Brand name</label>
            <input id="brandName" name="brandName" type="text"
              maxlength="70" value="KREOVANTA" required>
          </div>

          <div class="brand-field">
            <label for="brandPrimary">Primary colour</label>
            <input id="brandPrimary" name="brandPrimary"
              type="color" value="#12362b" required>
            <span class="brand-help">Used for your main brand colour.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="brand-field">
            <label for="brandAccent">Accent colour</label>
            <input id="brandAccent" name="brandAccent"
              type="color" value="#b48a2c" required>
            <span class="brand-help">Used for highlights and details.</span>
          </div>

          <div class="brand-field">
            <label for="brandBackground">Background colour</label>
            <input id="brandBackground" name="brandBackground"
              type="color" value="#f7f1e3" required>
          </div>

          <div class="brand-field">
            <label for="brandFont">Heading font</label>
            <select id="brandFont" name="brandFont">
              <option value="Cormorant Garamond">Cormorant Garamond</option>
              <option value="Playfair Display">Playfair Display</option>
              <option value="DM Sans">DM Sans</option>
              <option value="Inter">Inter</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div class="brand-field">
            <label for="brandLogoUrl">Logo image URL (optional)</label>
            <input id="brandLogoUrl" name="brandLogoUrl" type="url"
              inputmode="url" placeholder="https://example.com/logo.png">
            <span class="brand-help">
              Use a publicly accessible HTTPS image URL. A logo uploaded
              directly from your phone is not supported yet.
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="brand-actions">
            <button class="brand-save" type="submit">Save Brand Kit</button>
            <button class="brand-reset" id="brand-kit-reset" type="button">
              Restore defaults
            </button>
          </div>

          <p id="brand-kit-status" class="brand-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
      </section>

      <section class="brand-panel" aria-labelledby="brand-preview-title">
        <h2 id="brand-preview-title">Live preview</h2>

        <div class="brand-preview" id="brand-preview">
          <div class="brand-preview-top">
            <small>YOUR CREATIVE IDENTITY</small>
          </div>

          <div class="brand-preview-main">
            <img id="brand-preview-logo" class="brand-preview-logo"
              alt="Brand logo preview" hidden>

            <h3 id="brand-preview-name">KREOVANTA</h3>

            <p>
              Ideas deserve an extraordinary space. Make your next creative
              project unmistakably yours.
            </p>

            <span class="brand-preview-chip">Your brand, your way</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="brand-swatches" aria-label="Brand colour preview">
          <div class="brand-swatch">
            <div class="brand-swatch-color"
              style="background:var(--preview-primary,#12362b)"></div>
            <span>Primary</span>
          </div>

          <div class="brand-swatch">
            <div class="brand-swatch-color"
              style="background:var(--preview-accent,#b48a2c)"></div>
            <span>Accent</span>
          </div>

          <div class="brand-swatch">
            <div class="brand-swatch-color"
              style="background:var(--preview-background,#f7f1e3)"></div>
            <span>Background</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="brand-local-note">
          <strong>Storage notice:</strong> Your Brand Kit is currently saved
          only in this browser on this device. It is not yet synced to an
          account or shared across devices.
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
